## General Concepts 
# Exact Match
spec:Model .
spec:Concept  skos:exactMatch  am:Concept , jw:Concept , km3:Concept , km4:Concept .
spec:Element  skos:exactMatch  am:Element , jw:Element , km3:Element , km4:Element .
spec:Identifier .

#Close Match
spec:Relationship  skos:closeMatch  am:Relationship , jw:Relationship .
